On Jun 3, 8:54=A0am, Darklon <h8mach...@hotmail.co.uk> wrote:
> If i were to summon a Water Demon/s and they started to
> attack would she jump to my aid?, is there a =A0chance she maybe
> attacked? and if so would she fight with her usual magic-missle
> attacks?.


Usually no, but there is a corner case.  If you confuse or stun the
demon (e.g. with a scroll of confuse monster) there is a chance it
will accidentally hit the Oracle.  Similarly, if you somehow make it
hallucinate, it might decide to attack and provoke the Oracle.
Finally, a ring of conflict or similar item  might also cause the
water demon to deliberately attack the oracle

In each case, the Oracle should return fire with magic missiles.  The
Oracle's attack is powerful enough that it has a high chance of
killing the water demon outright.  If you are a low-level character
with a potion of confusion in your inventory and no escape items, who
happens to get ambushed by a water demon, it's worth a try as a last-
ditch attempt to save your life.


